Connectivity
============

There are many connectivity options available on the |product| industrial PC. It has |spec:USB|, |spec:LAN| (RJ45) Ethernet connector supporting up to 1 Gbps, and 5 x UART terminals (RS232/RS485).

RS232/RS485
-----------

The serial communication interfaces (RS485 and RS232) are routed to a **16-pin 3.81mm terminal**, as illustrated on the figure below.

Serial communication on both RS485 and RS232 interfaces can reach up to 115200 kbps.

.. attention::

    #) Pin 13 to Pin 16 are not connected (NC). Pin 13 and Pin 14 can be configured to RS232 **(optional)**.
    #) The 120Ω match resistor for the RS485 is mounted by default.
    #) RS485_3, RS485_4 and RS485_5 can control the input and output direction automatically. There’s no need to control it from within the software.

